  "createdAt": 1788873265694,
  "notes": "RSI(rsiLength) with Bollinger Bands computed on the RSI series (basis = SMA of RSI, dev = stdev of RSI). rsiValue binding is auto-derived; basis/dev are source-composed. Bands inlined into the conditions since they're arithmetic, not indicators."
